Third-party work
----------------

Unscroll adapts hook points (fingerprints) and small patch fragments from the
following GPL-3.0 projects. Files containing adapted code say so in their header.

* Metra TikTok Patches — https://github.com/icysymmetra/tiktok-patches-for-morphe
  (GPL-3.0 with additional section 7 terms, see below)
* ReVanced Patches — https://gitlab.com/ReVanced/revanced-patches (GPL-3.0)

Unscroll is built with, and its patch bundle is loaded by, the Morphe patcher
(https://github.com/MorpheApp), which is not bundled in this repository.

